{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99368","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99368/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99368/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99368/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99368","id":2666320918,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6e7NQW","number":99368,"title":"Color picker in `ColorRect` node flickers rapidly until the color wheel is clicked for the first time.","user":{"login":"Henry-DorsettCase","id":188787980,"node_id":"U_kgDOC0CtDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188787980?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase","html_url":"https://github.com/Henry-DorsettCase","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Henry-DorsettCase/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-17T19:03:04Z","updated_at":"2024-11-18T09:48:58Z","closed_at":"2024-11-18T08:24:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nIssue can be reproduced in Godot v4.3.stable. I also tested Godot 4.4 dev snapshot 4 and 4.2.2 stable; the issue is also present in both of those releases.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Ubuntu 24.04.1 LTS 24.04 - X11 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (nvidia; 550.120) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-14900KF (32 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I use the color picker to select a color from the `ColorRect`' s color wheel, the color flickers rapidly. Even when I don't move the mouse at all, the flashing persists. Clicking once on the wheel causes all flickering the stop.\r\n\r\nHere's a video I recorded (in v4.3) that demonstrates the behavior. (**Warning: flashing lights.**)\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 2024-11-17 19-24-34.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6924267-625e-40e8-962d-39350bb9709c)\r\n\r\nAround fifteen seconds into the video, I clicked on the wheel. This put an end to the flickering.\r\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project; select Forward+.\r\n2. Create a new scene and add a `ColorRect` node.\r\n3. In the inspector, open the color wheel.\r\n4. Click on the color picker button.\r\n5. Place the mouse anywhere on the wheel. This should cause flickering.\r\n6. Optional: click once anywhere on the wheel to make the flickering stop.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[color_picker_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17791970/color_picker_bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Henry-DorsettCase","id":188787980,"node_id":"U_kgDOC0CtDA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubus